    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc95ONANI\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\ud83d\udc49\ud83d\udc4c</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530690/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.poster.avif?t=1752731164\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530690/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.webm?t=1752731164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530690/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.mp4?t=1752731164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530690/extras/63c593c1cddb84165dcca04684de08bd.avif?t=1752731164\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Blood Rose ~ Origin of the Plague ~&quot; is a short adult 2D shoting rpg developed by nikukyu and published by 072 Project.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530690/extras/906528902493a8298dc67bf05a0afda2.avif?t=1752731164\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Agent Rosetta, explore the mansion and uncover the cause of the large-scale outbreak of the biochemical virus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530690/extras/e0bf122c75d98e5466dff411cc7d5fe3.avif?t=1752731164\" /></span>After x days of a bio-virus pandemic, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >although the situation is gradually calming down, no one knows where the virus originated from. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, the British intelligence agency discovers that a doctor living in a country </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in the easternmost likely the mastermind behind it all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With very few personnel available to act in this ongoing crisis, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the only one selected is a member of the team with the most agile and cautious skills, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Rosetta Aldridge&quot;. Rosetta, along with her support partner &quot;Oluton Zakariya&quot;, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >head to the doctor's mansion alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530690/extras/b64f6af4bdaa5c799e82fa49ea36b3a3.avif?t=1752731164\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530690/extras/2ba15892b50518bd11fa3cde72a0ddc2.avif?t=1752731164\" /></span>Rosetta was instructed by the Intelligence Bureau to go to the Far East, to the residence of a doctor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the truth about the large-scale outbreak of a biochemical virus. However, she discovered a mysterious underground basement in the mansion, along with a horde of zombies!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the zombies while searching for clues to advance the plot! Don't leave any walls unchecked!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And don't forget to use the radio to exchange information with your partner &quot;Oluton&quot; at any time; he might provide some useful Information.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530690/extras/2ba15892b50518bd11fa3cde72a0ddc2.avif?t=1752731164\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D gun battle action RPG game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape Puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clothing damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be cleared as a virgin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can skip dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports full-screen mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keys can be changed/Gamepad can be used</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memory Mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530690/extras/63c593c1cddb84165dcca04684de08bd.avif?t=1752731164\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Blood Rose ~ Origin of the Plague ~&quot; is a short adult 2D shoting rpg developed by nikukyu and published by 072 Project.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530690/extras/906528902493a8298dc67bf05a0afda2.avif?t=1752731164\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Agent Rosetta, explore the mansion and uncover the cause of the large-scale outbreak of the biochemical virus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530690/extras/e0bf122c75d98e5466dff411cc7d5fe3.avif?t=1752731164\" /></span>After x days of a bio-virus pandemic, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >although the situation is gradually calming down, no one knows where the virus originated from. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, the British intelligence agency discovers that a doctor living in a country </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in the easternmost likely the mastermind behind it all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With very few personnel available to act in this ongoing crisis, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the only one selected is a member of the team with the most agile and cautious skills, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Rosetta Aldridge&quot;. Rosetta, along with her support partner &quot;Oluton Zakariya&quot;, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >head to the doctor's mansion alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat